Vikram and Betal: The Honest Friend (Raw Story)

id: WBX_100142

King Vikram was carrying Betal through the forest once again.

Betal began his story.

“Once there were two close friends,” said Betal. “They trusted each other very much.”

One day, one friend made a mistake but tried to hide it.

The other friend noticed something was wrong.

He gently asked, “Is everything okay?”

The first friend felt guilty and told the truth.

Instead of getting angry, the second friend said, “Thank you for being honest.”

He helped his friend correct the mistake.

Their friendship became even stronger.

Betal then asked, “Vikram, what made their friendship strong?”

Vikram replied, “Honesty and understanding made their friendship strong.”

As soon as Vikram spoke, Betal flew back to the tree.

💖 Moral:

Honesty makes friendships stronger.
